    {
      "id": "a100000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -830,
      "y": -740,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### ⛓️ Asynchronous Micro-Chain DAG\n- **Ed25519 Account Micro-Chains**: Every sovereign actor and Hermes agent owns an asynchronous micro-chain.\n- **Zero Gas Fees ($0.00 / 0 Gwei)**: Dual-block consensus (SEND + RECEIVE) eliminates mempool fee auctions.\n- **Sub-25ms Finality**: High-concurrency DAG without global chain bottlenecks or head-of-line blocking.\n- **SHA-256 Micro-Stamp**: Fast sub-20ms anti-spam proof-of-work stamp replaces gas costs."
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1070,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### ⚡ 5-Validator Byzantine Fault Tolerant (BFT) Quorum\n- **Quorum Equation**: Requires $\\ge 4/5$ (80%) Byzantine signatures for state finality.\n- **5 Regional Validator Nodes**:\n  1. Node 1 (US-East Virginia) · 1.2ms latency anchor\n  2. Node 2 (EU-Central Frankfurt) · 14.8ms GDPR anchor\n  3. Node 3 (AP-East Tokyo) · 22.4ms APAC anchor\n  4. Node 4 (Local Edge Desktop) · 0.4ms loopback peer\n  5. Node 5 (NullAI Sovereign Core) · 0.8ms attestation anchor\n- **Sub-Second Epoch Checkpoints**: Merkle root state snapshots published every 10 blocks."
    },
    {
      "id": "b200000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 50,
      "y": -800,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 720,
      "label": "⛏️ PoUW Cognitive Mining & Neuro-Memory STDP Engrams (:8094)",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b200000000000011",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "06-Wiki/Vaelor Account-Lattice & PoUW Protocol.md",
      "x": 90,
