      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b200000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": -740,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 🧠 PoUW Cognitive Mining Engine\n- **Proof-of-Useful-Work (PoUW)**: Replaces wasteful hashing with verified cognitive work.\n- **STDP Obsidian Indexing**: Computes TF-IDF vector projections, AST wikilink topologies, and JSON Canvas synthesis.\n- **+15.9 ◈ VLR Base Reward**: Minted per valid cognitive block verified by 5/5 BFT quorum.\n- **Self-Tuning Difficulty**: Auto-adjusts cognitive complexity based on cluster node count."
    },
    {
      "id": "b200000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 330,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### 🧬 Biological Memory Substrate Integration (:8094)\n- **Bidirectional Engram Recording**: Every mined block writes a high-importance STDP memory engram (importance: 1.0, category: architecture).\n- **Hippocampal Replay**: Consolidated during sleep replay cycles into long-term cortex clusters.\n- **Cross-Cluster Synaptic Bridges**: Links financial mining transactions to OS, Studio, and Agent wikilinks.\n- **REST RPC**: `POST /api/obsidian/vaelor/mine` & `GET /api/obsidian/vaelor`."
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -1350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 720,
      "label": "💎 Native L1 Financial Primitives (Vaults, BNPL, Receipts)",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1310,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 📈 8.5% Compute Savings Vaults\n- **Real-Yield Engine**: 8.5% APY baseline yield backed by NullAI compute cluster rental and agent tool fees.\n- **Hourly Auto-Compounding**: Epoch interest distributions compound automatically with zero gas costs.\n- **Flexible & 90-Day Lock Tiers**: Liquid withdrawals anytime or lock for up to 12.5% boosted APY."
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -890,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 💳 0% APR BNPL Micro-Credit\n- **Reputation-Backed Credit**: Based on historical on-chain volume, merchant reviews, and validator staking.\n- **4-Installment Schedule**: Split commercial purchases into 4 equal bi-weekly payments with 0% APR.\n- **Autonomous Escrow Settlement**: Auto-deducted from revenue streams or bonded vault reserves."
    },
    {
      "id": "c300000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1100,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 🧾 Smart Receipts & Sub-Account Envelopes\n- **Itemized SHA-256 Receipts**: Full line-item details, SKU proofs, and 365-day warranty metadata encrypted for the buyer.\n- **Sub-Account Envelopes**: Isolate funds into budget categories (@zoth/saas, @zoth/groceries, @zoth/agents).\n- **Hardware-Enforced Spending Caps**: Daily and per-transaction limits enforced at the consensus lattice layer."
    },
    {
      "id": "d400000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 720,
      "label": "🛡️ Security, Privacy Shield & 10-Tool MCP Stratum",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d400000000000011",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Vaelor Network.md",
