    },
    {
      "id": "d400000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### 🔒 Shielded Pedersen Commitments\n- **Homomorphic Blinding**: Balance commitments formatted as C = vG + rH, concealing transferred values.\n- **Bulletproof Range Proofs**: Guarantees balances are non-negative without revealing numerical amounts.\n- **Auditor View Keys**: Selective cryptographic disclosure for sovereign accounting and tax attestation."
    },
    {
      "id": "d400000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 🛡️ Anti-Phishing @Handle Guard\n- **Human-Readable Handles**: Eliminates confusing hex addresses (@1nc0gn30, @zoth, @studio).\n- **Hamming-Distance Defense**: Consensus blocks reject typosquatted or visually confusing address lookalikes.\n- **Verified Merchant Badging**: Signed Ed25519 PKI badges verified via Cosign and VirusTotal notarization."
    },
    {
      "id": "d400000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 🧰 10-Tool Vaelor MCP & vaelor-cli\n- **10 Autonomous Agent Tools**: get_status, get_balance, transfer, mine_pouw, create_escrow, release_escrow, open_vault, bnpl_split, verify_receipt, register_handle.\n- **vaelor-cli & Second Brain Command #13**:\n  `zoth-second-brain vaelor [--mine] [--json]`\n- **Dual Cash Registers**: Embedded in 71 Zoth Studio web tools."
    }
